<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING FRENCH LEAGUE SCORERS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first</p>
<p>division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>8 - Anton Drobnjak (Bastia), Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>6 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), David Zitelli (Strasbourg), Mihalin</p>
<p>Becanovic (Lille), Leonardo (Paris SG)</p>
<p>5 - Japhet N'Doram (Nantes), Sonny Anderson (Monaco)</p>
<p>4 - Lubomir Moravcik (Bastia), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux),</p>
<p>Christopher Wreh (Guingamp), Mohammed Chaouch (Nice), Xavier</p>
<p>Gravelaine (Marseille).</p>
</text>
